WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(applause)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.700
- You know I love stores that
put a smile on your face.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.610
I find them and serve them
up fresh. You're welcome.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.882
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:07.215
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:09.410
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:11.070
Last Christmas, I introduced you

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.990
to an amazing second grader
from upstate New York.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.820
Eight year old Santii had
a simple Christmas wish:

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.020
to raise money for new
playground equipment

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.213
everyone could enjoy, even kids
in wheelchairs. Take a look.

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:23.046
(swooshing sound)

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:23.980
I hear Santii that you were

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.980
inspired to give back after a trip

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:28.540
to the playground one day,
can you tell us what happened?

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:31.400
- Well, I saw a little
girl in a wheelchair

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.658
and she couldn't play with anything.

00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:34.487
So, I thought all kids in wheelchairs

00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:36.820
would like accessible swing,

00:00:37.715 --> 00:00:39.297
so they could feel the wind in their hair.

00:00:39.297 --> 00:00:40.130
(swooshing sound)

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:40.963
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:00:40.963 --> 00:00:42.062
- Oh my god, so cute.

00:00:42.062 --> 00:00:42.935
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:00:42.935 --> 00:00:46.159
After our show, Santii
got a call from the city.

00:00:46.159 --> 00:00:47.532
They were so inspired.

00:00:47.532 --> 00:00:49.288
They didn't just want
to buy new equipment.

00:00:49.288 --> 00:00:51.806
They wanted to build a brand new park.

00:00:51.806 --> 00:00:53.584
So on top of our $5,000,

00:00:53.584 --> 00:00:56.300
they kicked in 165,000.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.425
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:00:57.425 --> 00:00:59.452
To build a state of the art park

00:00:59.452 --> 00:01:03.174
the most inclusive and accessible
in all of New York state.

00:01:03.174 --> 00:01:05.638
It just opened up last month and get this:

00:01:05.638 --> 00:01:07.866
Santii's name is actually
on the equipment.

00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:09.430
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:11.883
Let's get her in here
along with her mama, Becca.

00:01:11.883 --> 00:01:12.726
Hi y'all!

00:01:12.726 --> 00:01:14.729
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:15.610
- Hi!

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:16.493
- Hello!

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:19.800
I am so proud of you.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.620
I mean, you must be blown away.

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.500
Like this is an advanced
park. Can you tell us about?

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.223
- There this is amazing We-Go-Swing

00:01:27.223 --> 00:01:29.560
and it looks like a boat

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.740
and kids and wheelchairs
and you can go on it

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.412
and you pump it back and forth.

00:01:34.412 --> 00:01:37.380
And then there's this amazing We-Go-Round

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.680
that has my name on it.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.489
And I also got to help build it.

00:01:41.489 --> 00:01:43.751
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:01:43.751 --> 00:01:44.970
...spin it really fast!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.220
And two kids in wheel chairs click in

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.390
so they're nice and safe.

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.553
It's awesome!

00:01:49.553 --> 00:01:51.116
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:01:51.116 --> 00:01:51.960
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.100
I love you so much, Santii,

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.924
you are... you just make
me smile inside out.

00:01:56.924 --> 00:02:00.080
So you're also planning on
expanding everything, right?

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:00.970
- Yes.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.760
- Okay. So what's up? What's
the new thing you want to do?

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.850
- Match you guys on a slide!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.558
(crowd applauds and laughs)

00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:10.050
- I love it.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.110
My kids love slides.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.770
Well, thank you so much, Santii
and Becca for joining us.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.598
I'm liking your posts right now, okay?

00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:17.431
(crowd applauds and cheers)

00:02:17.431 --> 00:02:18.620
And that's not all!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.580
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.510
the go-to pen of The
Kelly Clarkson Show likes

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:26.150
to celebrate those who create
fearlessly, just like you.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.260
So they'll be using their
friction erasable pen

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.458
to write you a check
for a thousand dollars.

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:33.000
(applause and laughter)

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.213
I love you!

